---
import:
  - from /shared import tokens
---

Root: [[/]]
Absolute: [[/m/]] is the folder note, [[/m]] the card beside it
Unqualified: [[m/]] is the folder note, [[m]] the card
Relative: [[../../m/]] [[../]]
Import: [[tokens]] is the import, [[tokens/]] is not
Search: [[deep/]] finds the folder note only, [[deep]] finds both
